{"title":"Alpha Werewolf","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\"><p class=\"wp-lede\">A level 35 Werewolf that attacks with slash (melee).</p>\n      <h2>Fighting it</h2><div class=\"s\"><i>Weak</i> <span class=\"tag-chip weak\">burn</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">shock</span><span class=\"tag-chip weak\">slash</span> &nbsp; <i>Resists</i> <span class=\"tag-chip resist\">freeze</span><span class=\"tag-chip resist\">crush</span></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">A weakness adds 30% damage and a resistance takes 30% off (the game's own rule).</p>\n      <p class=\"s good\">⭐ Seen as an elite 15 times (4.3% of sightings). Elites have 3× HP, hit 1.4× harder, give 3× XP and 2.5× loot.</p>\n      <p class=\"s\">Special: frenzyCadenceMult: .7</p>\n      <p class=\"s\"><b>Reagent:</b> <a href=\"#/item/lycan-claw\">Lycan Claw</a> <span class=\"muted\">(infuses an enchant)</span>. A small chance on any kill, far better from elites. <a href=\"#/guide/reforging\">Reforging</a></p>\n      <h2>Levels</h2><div class=\"q-picker\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Level\"><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf\">All levels</a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=34\">Lv 34 <span>75</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=35\">Lv 35 <span>68</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=36\">Lv 36 <span>78</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=37\">Lv 37 <span>64</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=44\">Lv 44 <span>7</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=45\">Lv 45 <span>11</span></a><a class=\"q-chip\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=46\">Lv 46 <span>13</span></a><a class=\"q-chip on\" href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=47\">Lv 47 <span>6</span></a></div>\n      <p class=\"s muted\">The same monster spawns at different levels, and its hitpoints, damage and XP follow its level (the game’s own formula). In the game a monster more than 5 levels above you shows its level as “???”.</p>\n      <div class=\"g-scroll\"><table class=\"g-table q-table\"><thead><tr><th>Level</th><th>HP</th><th>Damage</th><th>XP</th><th>Elite (HP · dmg · XP)</th><th>Seen</th><th>Mostly</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=34\" title=\"Pick level 34\"><td><b>34</b></td><td>145</td><td>23.2</td><td>1,700</td><td class=\"muted\">435 · 32.5 · 5,100</td><td>75</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=35\" title=\"Pick level 35\"><td><b>35</b> <span class=\"muted\">(base)</span></td><td>152</td><td>23.8</td><td>1,750</td><td class=\"muted\">456 · 33.3 · 5,250</td><td>68</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=36\" title=\"Pick level 36\"><td><b>36</b></td><td>160</td><td>24.3</td><td>1,800</td><td class=\"muted\">480 · 34 · 5,400</td><td>78</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=37\" title=\"Pick level 37\"><td><b>37</b></td><td>168</td><td>24.9</td><td>1,850</td><td class=\"muted\">504 · 34.9 · 5,550</td><td>64</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=44\" title=\"Pick level 44\"><td><b>44</b></td><td>233</td><td>28.7</td><td>2,200</td><td class=\"muted\">699 · 40.2 · 6,600</td><td>7</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=45\" title=\"Pick level 45\"><td><b>45</b></td><td>243</td><td>29.3</td><td>2,250</td><td class=\"muted\">729 · 41 · 6,750</td><td>11</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a></td></tr><tr class=\"\" data-href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf?lv=46\" title=\"Pick level 46\"><td><b>46</b></td><td>254</td><td>29.8</td><td>2,300</td><td class=\"muted\">762 · 41.7 · 6,900</td><td>13</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a></td></tr><tr class=\"q-row-on\" data-href=\"#/monster/alpha-werewolf\" title=\"Show all levels\"><td><b>47</b></td><td>266</td><td>30.4</td><td>2,350</td><td class=\"muted\">798 · 42.6 · 7,050</td><td>6</td><td>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"alpha-werewolf\" data-map-level=\"47\">Show level 47 on the map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra collector-monster-drops\"><b>Observed drops</b><div class=\"muted\">No kills of this monster reported yet; 26 looted corpses recorded.</div><div style=\"margin-top:8px\"><b>Normal loot</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\" title=\"Gold Coin - in 0% of 26 looted corpses, 47 recorded drops, 2,748 total, 19–214 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">0% · 0/26</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"werewolf-pelt\" title=\"Werewolf Pelt - in 100% of 26 looted corpses, 26 recorded drops, 26 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/ef6770c8d1b158c56195.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolf Pelt</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">100% · 26/26</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"mana-potion-large\" title=\"Mana Potion Large - in 8% of 26 looted corpses, 2 recorded drops, 2 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/a4a127458a5f5f489058.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mana Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">8% · 2/26</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"lycan-claw\" title=\"Lycan Claw - in 4% of 26 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/5886e8298d88b1961766.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Lycan Claw</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">4% · 1/26</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+3 more\">+3 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"werewolfpelt-legs\" title=\"Werewolfpelt Legs - in 4% of 26 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/d665ef86050cc2f37c8d.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Werewolfpelt Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">4% · 1/26</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ogrewax-legs\" title=\"Ogrewax Legs - in 4% of 26 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/661962eb273d384bc5cd.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogrewax Legs</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">4% · 1/26</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"stamina-potion-large\" title=\"Stamina Potion Large - in 4% of 26 looted corpses, 1 recorded drop, 1 total, 1 per drop\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/7fdf25f5efb0344b88a4.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Stamina Potion Large</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">4% · 1/26</span></div></div></div><div class=\"muted\" style=\"margin-top:8px\">Percentages are of the corpses whose loot the collector recorded, so kills you did not loot are not counted.</div></div>\n      <h2>Inside dungeons and buildings</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li><b>Moonfang&#39;s Lair</b> <span class=\"muted\">· 40</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-153\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      <h2>Where to find it</h2><ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>near <a href=\"#/map/place/Moonfang's%20Lair\">Moonfang&#39;s Lair</a> <span class=\"muted\">· 184 spots</span></li></ul><button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"monster\" data-map-id=\"alpha-werewolf\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Named ones <span class=\"muted\" style=\"font-size:14px\">(1)</span></h2><div class=\"named-grid\"><a class=\"named-card\" href=\"#/npc/moonfang\"><img src=\"data/img/2461f7274d9dae8320ea.webp\" alt=\"\"><b>Moonfang</b><span>Lv 37</span></a></div>\n      <h2>Related</h2><p>Other Werewolf: <a href=\"#/monster/lycan\">Lycan</a> <span class=\"muted\">(24)</span> · <a href=\"#/monster/werewolf\">Werewolf</a> <span class=\"muted\">(30)</span></p>\n      <p class=\"wp-guides\"><b>Guides:</b> <a href=\"#/guide/combat\">Combat</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monster-families\">Monster families</a> · <a href=\"#/guide/monsters-by-level\">Monsters by level</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/fc7711ec9ecca6b88e5c.webp\" alt=\"Alpha Werewolf\"></div><h3>Alpha Werewolf</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td><b>47</b> <span class=\"muted\">(picked · base 35)</span></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Family</th><td>Werewolf</td></tr><tr><th>Attacks</th><td>slash · melee</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>266</td></tr><tr><th>Damage</th><td>30.4</td></tr><tr><th>XP</th><td>2,350</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Attack speed</th><td>3.6 s</td></tr><tr><th>Attack range</th><td>1.6</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Aggressive</th><td>Yes (7 tiles)</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Drops gems</th><td>No</td></tr><tr><th>Pendant / cape</th><td>Can drop</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Seen</th><td>347 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}